 professionally landscaped, park-like yard and large deck. The family room features a gas fireplace and picture window framing the valley views. Main-floor den and laundry complete the level. Extras include a 24 x 24 attached garage, RV parking, underground irrigation and an open basement with abundant storage. An exceptional home for families or executives (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$759,500"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,993 sq ft"],["Lot size","7,800 sq ft"],["Year built","1979"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Pineview Fort Sask."],["Town","Fort Saskatchewan"],["Postal code","T8L3K3"],["MLS® number","E4516489"],["Listed","November 13, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Water softener, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Alarm System, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Oven - Built-In, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s), Two Refrigerators"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage, RV"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.66 m × 4.10 m (18'7\" × 13'5\")"],["Dining room","Main level","4.21 m × 2.93 m (13'10\" × 9'7\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.10 m × 2.78 m (13'5\" × 9'1\")"],["Family room","Main level","5.82 m × 4.02 m (19'1\" × 13'2\")"],["Den","Main level","2.85 m × 2.78 m (9'4\" × 9'1\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.27 m × 4.15 m (14'0\" × 13'7\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","3.37 m × 2.93 m (11'1\" × 9'7\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.96 m × 2.85 m (13'0\" × 9'4\")"],["Laundry room","Main level",""],["Breakfast","Main level","4.10 m × 2.36 m (13'5\" × 7'9\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","7.91 m × 7.20 m (25'11\" × 23'7\")"]],"courtesy":"Shayne Sharpe, Royal LePage Noralta Real Estate","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"fort-saskatchewan","hood_slug":"pineview-fort-sask","area":""}